  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Disaster Resilience Improvement Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Second Disaster Resilience Improvement Program will support the government in strengthening its policies and institutional frameworks on DRRM, including disaster response, at national and subnational levels. In so doing, it will help the Philippines adopt an anticipatory approach to disaster response and achieve long-term resilience by addressing underlying sources of risks in its systems.</narrative>
  </description>
